OL,3,AInside Ukrainian offensive pushing
OL,4,ARussia back - with Starlink playing a
OL,5,Akey role
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Russian drone zips across the
OL,8,Fcomputer screen, startling the
OL,9,Fcommanders keeping watch over the
OL,10,Fbattlefield via a live stream in their
OL,11,Fbunker.
OL,13,FCigarette in one hand, radio in the
OL,14,Fother, one of them calls in their own
OL,15,Fdrone to bring it down and warns the
OL,16,Fsoldiers below of the threat. The men
OL,17,Fare dangerously exposed, on the long
OL,18,Fwalk across open ground from their
OL,19,Ffront line positions. They are being
OL,20,Freplaced after three months forcing the
OL,21,FRussians back.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
