OL,3,AInside Ukrainian offensive pushing
OL,4,ARussia back - with Starlink playing a
OL,5,Akey role
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis is part of Operation Vivaldi, a
OL,8,FUkrainian counter-offensive which they
OL,9,Fsay has liberated 277 sq km (106 square
OL,10,Fmiles) in the eastern Donbas region in
OL,11,Frecent months.
OL,13,FThe name reflects the offensive's four
OL,14,Fstages, or seasons - like the Italian
OL,15,Fcomposer's violin concerto. The
OL,16,Fsuccessful assault blunted an attempted
OL,17,FRussian pincer movement that threatened
OL,18,Fto encircle the key Fortress Belt
OL,19,Fcities still under Ukrainian control.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
